{"artifact_path":".agents/trigger-engine.md","content":"## 3. Watcher constraints

A watcher / scheduler / dispatcher MUST NOT infer semantic approval. It may:

- match events;
- acquire lease;
- enqueue command;
- append trigger-fired evidence;
- retry transport;
- notify parent or root.

It MUST NOT:

- approve completion;
- create command outside its authority;
- resolve conflicting claims without serial authority;
- rewrite event history.

